5c44b540-b1bf-4d63-a0b5-180434af2367	agri-seed-subsidy	Farmer Seed & Fertilizer Subsidy (Raitha Siri)	- Fill and save your application draft in OfflineBridge completely offline. - Obtain or verify your 12-digit FRUITS Farmer ID (FID) at the nearest Raitha Samparka Kendra (RSK). - Submit the verified draft details along with your RTC / Pahani record at your local RSK or Agriculture Assistant office before sowing season. - Upon biometric verification, collect subsidised certified seeds directly from the RSK distribution counter.	https://fruits.karnataka.gov.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Application Procedure and Official Portals", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.466Z", "chunkIndex": 5, "department": "Department of Agriculture, Govt. of Karnataka", "documentId": "scheme-agri-seed-subsidy-en", "contentHash": "52ce033e0a475c43b5c6c81814461eb3facb61cde20c9fddbcab74f59da729b2", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Farmer Seed & Fertilizer Subsidy (Raitha Siri)", "lastVerifiedDate": null, "verificationStatus": "provisional_catalogue_entry"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.491146+00
