7b17f9b8-16a8-4c32-973c-2d2959ee33b1	pm-kisan	PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)	- Aadhaar Card of landholder - Bhoomi RTC / Land Record extract - FRUITS Farmer Registration ID (FID) - Active Bank Passbook seeded with Aadhaar and NPCI	https://pmkisan.gov.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Required Documents", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.470Z", "chunkIndex": 4, "department": "Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare / Dept of Agriculture, Karnataka", "documentId": "scheme-pm-kisan-en", "contentHash": "b8e110c74d26b3f827465be79b2051f5691698c1966cf6be1d707d01dd4dab37", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.59739+00
4692f855-5dfa-4fd6-b43e-754505862e61	pm-kisan	PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)	- Prepare application details and document readiness using the offline draft form in OfflineBridge. - Verify mandatory eligibility criteria and required documents checklist. - Submit final application through the verified government department portal or at your local Grama One / Bangalore One centre.	https://pmkisan.gov.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Application Procedure and Official Portals", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.470Z", "chunkIndex": 5, "department": "Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare / Dept of Agriculture, Karnataka", "documentId": "scheme-pm-kisan-en", "contentHash": "1d3c7b940bec47992feb840264019f824cd029d24cda98fcf900945ccb163919", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "PM-KISAN (Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.600201+00
