502316c8-7b15-4b16-abd0-7d8bd49baec4	anna-bhagya	ಅನ್ನಭಾಗ್ಯ ಯೋಜನೆ (ಉಚಿತ ಆಹಾರ ಧಾನ್ಯ ಮತ್ತು ನಗದು ಡಿಬಿಟಿ)	- ಆಹಾರ ಪೋರ್ಟಲ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಅರ್ಹ ಕಾರ್ಡುದಾರರಿಗೆ ಸ್ವಯಂಚಾಲಿತವಾಗಿ ಸೌಲಭ್ಯ ಲಭ್ಯ. - ಆಹಾರ ವೆಬ್‌ಸೈಟ್ (ahara.kar.nic.in) ನಲ್ಲಿ ಡಿಬಿಟಿ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಪರಿಶೀಲಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳಿ. - ಪ್ರತಿ ತಿಂಗಳು ನಿಗದಿತ ದಿನಾಂಕದೊಳಗೆ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕ್ ಖಾತೆಗೆ ನಗದು ಜಮೆ.	https://ahara.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "ಅರ್ಜಿ ಸಲ್ಲಿಸುವ ವಿಧಾನ ಮತ್ತು ಅಧಿಕೃತ ಸಂಪರ್ಕ", "language": "kn", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 5, "department": "ಆಹಾರ, ನಾಗರಿಕ ಸರಬರಾಜು ಮತ್ತು ಗ್ರಾಹಕರ ವ್ಯವಹಾರಗಳ ಇಲಾಖೆ", "documentId": "scheme-anna-bhagya-kn", "contentHash": "92f2b5b89d298d9f3762f95ac2ed5a355e98ff13ee129a79e89589c79576a485", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "ಅನ್ನಭಾಗ್ಯ ಯೋಜನೆ (ಉಚಿತ ಆಹಾರ ಧಾನ್ಯ ಮತ್ತು ನಗದು ಡಿಬಿಟಿ)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.840952+00
8bac41dc-035b-4f5b-b404-a9816c3762e7	ganga-kalyana	Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)	Scheme Name: Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells) Department: Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations Category: farmer Official Portal: https://sw.kar.nic.in Department Helpline: 080-22207784 / 1902	https://sw.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Scheme: Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 0, "department": "Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations", "documentId": "scheme-ganga-kalyana-en", "contentHash": "de8c30815a075e51246679c8e56b9388ec1c6baa014e950156bda494989626fb", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.844132+00
f7f8273e-2855-481a-9978-0b3b610bdddd	ganga-kalyana	Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)	Provides free individual or community irrigation borewells, casing pipes, submersible pumps, and electricity energization for small/marginal farmers belonging to SC, ST, OBC, and Minority communities.	https://sw.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Overview and Objectives", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 1, "department": "Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations", "documentId": "scheme-ganga-kalyana-en", "contentHash": "1223eb864b7b2e64f06f91ed0a60db7ad07d91836ef07ec86697df9c65a89e81", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.846987+00
823ffbd1-48ad-4abf-bd81-da0444f8b56b	ganga-kalyana	Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)	- Complete funding up to ₹3.50 lakh for individual borewell drilling, casing, and pump set. - Up to ₹4.50 lakh for community lift irrigation borewells for groups of farmers. - Free power transmission line and electrical transformer setup by ESCOM.	https://sw.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Benefits and Financial Assistance", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 2, "department": "Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations", "documentId": "scheme-ganga-kalyana-en", "contentHash": "bfc13d903a2d42a217e22f7e5b6a995686d785570dca64c14c8b6432108f2d4d", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.850088+00
2d9ce675-eef8-42d5-83a9-40e9644cf235	ganga-kalyana	Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)	- Applicant must belong to SC, ST, Backward Classes, or Minority community. - Must possess minimum 1.5 to 5 acres of dry agricultural land (2 to 5 contiguous acres for group). - Annual family income must not exceed ₹1.5 lakh for rural areas (₹2.0 lakh for urban). - No other member of family should have availed Ganga Kalyana benefit earlier.	https://sw.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Eligibility Criteria", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 3, "department": "Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations", "documentId": "scheme-ganga-kalyana-en", "contentHash": "5143ba57cfa70281edda976363ea38a03b5c0365b914ec5c2fe99516bfb8c870", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.853258+00
44a60f4a-556b-4432-ae0f-b85e4373d714	ganga-kalyana	Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)	- Caste and Income certificate RD number from Nada Kacheri - Bhoomi RTC and Land Tax receipt - Groundwater Authority feasibility certificate (Hydrologist report) - Aadhaar card and Bank passbook	https://sw.kar.nic.in	{"page": 1, "section": "Required Documents", "language": "en", "createdAt": "2026-11-10T17:59:45.472Z", "chunkIndex": 4, "department": "Social Welfare / Backward Classes / Minorities Development Corporations", "documentId": "scheme-ganga-kalyana-en", "contentHash": "41c3df18b491ee61d13bd0b1b72efbbf989fdafa90923d28bef4d5a9c17eed51", "totalChunks": 6, "documentTitle": "Ganga Kalyana Scheme (Free Irrigation Borewells)", "lastVerifiedDate": "2026-03-31", "verificationStatus": "officially_verified"}	2026-11-10 17:59:45.856177+00
