COPY public.schemes (id, title, department, category, description, eligibility_criteria, eligibility_rules, is_active, created_at, updated_at) FROM stdin;
old-age-pension	Senior Citizen Pension Scheme (Sandhya Suraksha)	Directorate of Social Security and Pensions, Revenue Dept.	citizen	Monthly subsistence pension of ₹1,200 for rural and urban elderly citizens aged 65 and above from economically weaker families.	Applicant must be 65 years of age or older.\nMust be a resident of Karnataka for at least 3 consecutive years.\nCombined annual income of applicant and spouse must be below ₹32,000 (rural) or ₹40,000 (urban).\nApplicant must not be receiving any other government, freedom fighter, or EPF pension.	{"minAge": 65, "maxIncome": 32000, "karnatakaResidentOnly": true}	t	2026-11-10 14:27:14.677885+00	2026-11-10 17:59:45.309342+00
