matru-poorna	Matru Poorna Scheme (Nutritious Meal for Mothers)	Department of Women & Child Development, Govt. of Karnataka	health	Provides one complete hot cooked nutritious mid-day meal, boiled egg/sprouted grains, milk, and iron-folic acid tablets daily to pregnant and lactating rural mothers at local Anganwadi centers.	All pregnant women and lactating mothers up to 6 months post-delivery residing in rural Karnataka.\nRegistered with local Anganwadi worker and Primary Health Center (PHC).	{"requiresRural": true, "karnatakaResidentOnly": true}	t	2026-11-10 17:59:45.441158+00	2026-11-10 17:59:45.441158+00
cmegp-subsidy	Chief Minister Employment Generation Programme (CMEGP)	Department of Commerce and Industries, Govt. of Karnataka	business	Credit-linked margin money subsidy up to 35% on manufacturing project costs up to ₹25.0 lakh and service projects up to ₹10.0 lakh for rural entrepreneurs and youth setting up micro-enterprises.	Age between 21 and 45 years (up to 50 years for SC, ST, Women, Minorities, Ex-servicemen).\nMinimum educational qualification: 8th standard pass.\nProject setup must be located in Karnataka; preference given to rural Gram Panchayat areas.	{"maxAge": 50, "minAge": 21, "karnatakaResidentOnly": true}	t	2026-11-10 17:59:45.445465+00	2026-11-10 17:59:45.445465+00
